,"props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Watching porn alone is fine, but don’t post it in groups, sell “resources,” or create groups"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Part-time jobs that ask you to use your own card to receive payments, withdraw cash, or transfer money — no matter how much extra pay they offer, avoid them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Some people try to get you to “package loan applicants” for them and offer a commission based on the loan amount — don’t fall for it"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Keeping found items and not using them for personal gain; returning lost phones, wallets, or cash to owners or police"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Use your real identity to claim discounts — don’t register fake accounts or exploit loopholes to get more"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Never throw anything from balconies or windows — cigarette butts, trash bags, and bottles all count"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Do not buy imitation guns, BB guns, or air rifles online; avoid “toy guns” of unknown origin"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Register drones with your real name first; never fly near airports, military zones, or restricted urban airspace, and don’t tamper with altitude limits"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Do not secretly film others, nor install cameras in rented apartments, homestays, or hotel rooms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Mahjong and poker can be played — no rake, no banker role, no organizing paid games, no online gambling"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Do not eat wild animals; do not buy, sell, or keep protected species as pets"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"You cannot detain or confine someone to collect a debt, nor follow them home and refuse to leave"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Do not lend your ID card, do not use someone else’s ID card, and do not register, open accounts, or buy tickets using another person’s documents"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Cooperate when stopped or taken away by police — don’t push, hit, or grab their body cameras; especially if you’ve been drinking, stay calm"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Sexual relations with anyone under 14 are illegal; “she consented” is not a defense"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Do the math before you hit someone: detention, fines, and prison time"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"If parents cannot care for their newborn, the only legal option is to register the adoption with the civil affairs bureau: paying someone to hand over the child may be prosecuted as child trafficking, while abandoning the child constitutes abandonment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Don’t fabricate accidents or exaggerate damages to defraud insurance payouts: this is insurance fraud, and anyone helping you testify, assess damage, or repair your vehicle is equally liable"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t sell your own organs, and don’t help others find donors: a kidney brings in just over $20,000, but the same kidney can be sold to a patient for $200,000. All proceeds are seized, plus a fine of 10–20 times the transaction amount"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Don’t engage in prostitution: the default penalty is 10–15 days in detention, not just a fine"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Distributing unauthorized Chinese-dubbed comics, pirated movies/TV shows, cloud storage links, and pirated e-books — even for free — is illegal; adding ads or charging membership fees can lead to criminal charges"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"To publish or monetize fan works, first obtain permission from the original copyright holder, or replace the borrowed characters’ names and relationships with your own"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Do not buy and carry batons, stun devices, daggers, or pepper spray for self-defense; keeping them in your car also counts as carrying"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/09"},"children":["Chapter 9"," ·"," ","Legal pitfalls that ordinary people often overlook"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"09-01"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"